(
    title: "Donald Duck\'s Speedboat",
    developer: Some("Suki Lee, Dave Joly"),
    description: Some("Atari\'s cancelled Disney tie-in, finished enough to appear boxed in European catalogues for a September 1983 release that never came: Donald races his speedboat through rocks, whirlpools and water hazards against the clock, and his nephews grade the run with a bronze, silver or gold cup. Two builds survive, six days apart, from when the game was still tentatively Donald Duck\'s Regatta."),
